DESCRIPTION:For over three weeks\, growth-hungry Jupiter faces off with yo
 ur natal Venus\, tucked quietly in your house of rest and inner world. Ven
 us there speaks of a private\, maybe hidden way you love and value yoursel
 f. This transit through your house of routines pushes you to expand what f
 eels good\, but also to question if your daily habits actually honor what 
 you value. Don't overpromise or overspend to feel worthy. → Where could 
 you add more ease to your routine without losing yourself?\n\n— Technica
 l detail: Jupiter within orb of opposition your Venus natal (house 12) · 
 exact: 01/10/26\n\n(until Oct 14)
