 st\, or merging with another person are ready for a new chapter. Venus\, r
 uler of this Moon\, sits naturally in your quiet twelfth house but now tra
 nsits this same intense house 8\, linking your private inner values to thi
 s transformation. Set an intention here with care\, this area asks for dep
 th\, not haste. Consider: 'I commit to naming what I truly need in shared 
